# River water. Deep teal blue, darker than the lobby tank, with slow ripple
# dashes that swell and drift. The flow cycle is the quiet one; glint adds a
# sparkle or two. Seamless in every direction. Nothing here is emissive.
sprite floor-water
size 16 16
layer floor
fps 3
tag floor water park

